# Build artifacts. The binary is built to ./golens by `go build ./cmd/golens`.
/golens
/golens.exe
/dist/
*.exe
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Coverage and profiling output.
*.prof
*.coverprofile

# Editor and OS cruft.
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# NOTE: testdata/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Golden fixtures are the evidence for
# acceptance criterion A12 and must be versioned so a formatting change shows up as a
# reviewable diff rather than as a silent test rewrite.

# Release archives.
/dist/
